<title>USA: Muni sales total $1.68 bln for week of Sept 3.</title>
<headline>Muni sales total $1.68 bln for week of Sept 3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive and negotiated municipal bond sales, depending on market conditions, could total $1.68 billion in 51 offerings for the week of September 3, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Competitive sales for the week are expected to total about $593 million in 31 offerings.</p>
<p>Negotiated sales, depending on market conditions, could total $1.08 billion in 20 offerings for the week. The largest issue is a $273.6 million New York State Thruway Authority issue through PaineWebber Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
